`s 963(1) the Panel must publish a report for the financial year` MEANS
    IF `the financial year has ended`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "After the end of each financial year the Panel must publish a report."

-- s 963(2): the report must set out how the Panel's functions were discharged, include its accounts, and mention matters it considers relevant.
-- src:13396 | (2) The report must—
-- src:13397 | (a) set out how the Panel's functions were discharged in the year in question;
